{"4694600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Whispers Of Gods", "steam_appid": 4694600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Whispers of Gods is a Dark Fantasy top-down ARPG, Souls-Like, set in the Victorian Era, re-imagined through the Lovecraftian Mythos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ashford Hollow, a cursed village swallowed by whispers from beyond. An ancient resonance known as The Voice drifts across the land, twisting the minds of humans and feeding an ever-growing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat is brutal, precise, and unforgiving.</strong> Master dodges, parries, charged strikes, and devastating combos. Swap between melee weapons and ranged attacks, and use your limited resources wisely. There's no room for button-mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/7520c7353a18e7dc4fa641cdaea34787.poster.avif?t=1785259737\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/7520c7353a18e7dc4fa641cdaea34787.webm?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/7520c7353a18e7dc4fa641cdaea34787.mp4?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MADNESS MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Madness</strong> is not just a story element, it’s a core mechanic. As your sanity fades, <strong>new enemies</strong>, <strong>hidden paths, hallucinations and items</strong> begin to emerge. The world shifts in real time, blurring the line between truth and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the only way forward is to lose yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/c3d23ed6e7208fd693df68606c1bcd53.poster.avif?t=1785259737\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/c3d23ed6e7208fd693df68606c1bcd53.webm?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/c3d23ed6e7208fd693df68606c1bcd53.mp4?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEEP RPG PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up by defeating enemies and collecting Whispers. Distribute attribute points across <strong>Strength</strong>, <strong>Dexterity</strong>, <strong>Precision</strong>, and <strong>Resistance stats</strong>, customizing your build to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/023e7ea32893eece5a112c004c7b63a1.poster.avif?t=1785259737\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/023e7ea32893eece5a112c004c7b63a1.webm?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/023e7ea32893eece5a112c004c7b63a1.mp4?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A DARK, MYSTERIOUS STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore Ashford Hollow, the city feels under siege, but by no army you can see. Only the Hollows remain: once-human, sentinels stripped of their minds by The Voice, endlessly patrolling the streets like puppets caught in a ritual they no longer understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/1783a27a07f3cbb6014b526adac1596f.poster.avif?t=1785259737\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/1783a27a07f3cbb6014b526adac1596f.webm?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/1783a27a07f3cbb6014b526adac1596f.mp4?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Precision-based combat inspired by Souls-like design,  read enemy intentions, punish openings, master timing, and survive lethal encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Major Boss Adaptability to the player's current weapons and madness gauge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deep RPG progression with fully customizable builds, stats, weapons, and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dynamic sanity system that reshapes gameplay, visuals, enemy behavior, and even fragments of the lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Environmental storytelling through hidden fragments of lore, world details, and enigmatic NPCS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Loot, inventory, quests, and equipment management integrated into a classic ARPG structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Victorian aesthetic fused with cosmic horror influences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Estimated playtime: 8+ hours per run (high replayability). (Work in progress)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“For the gods do whisper… and not all who hear remain whole.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Whispers of Gods is a Dark Fantasy top-down ARPG, Souls-Like, set in the Victorian Era, re-imagined through the Lovecraftian Mythos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ashford Hollow, a cursed village swallowed by whispers from beyond. An ancient resonance known as The Voice drifts across the land, twisting the minds of humans and feeding an ever-growing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat is brutal, precise, and unforgiving.</strong> Master dodges, parries, charged strikes, and devastating combos. Swap between melee weapons and ranged attacks, and use your limited resources wisely. There's no room for button-mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/7520c7353a18e7dc4fa641cdaea34787.poster.avif?t=1785259737\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/7520c7353a18e7dc4fa641cdaea34787.webm?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/7520c7353a18e7dc4fa641cdaea34787.mp4?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MADNESS MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Madness</strong> is not just a story element, it’s a core mechanic. As your sanity fades, <strong>new enemies</strong>, <strong>hidden paths, hallucinations and items</strong> begin to emerge. The world shifts in real time, blurring the line between truth and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the only way forward is to lose yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/c3d23ed6e7208fd693df68606c1bcd53.poster.avif?t=1785259737\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/c3d23ed6e7208fd693df68606c1bcd53.webm?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/c3d23ed6e7208fd693df68606c1bcd53.mp4?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEEP RPG PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up by defeating enemies and collecting Whispers. Distribute attribute points across <strong>Strength</strong>, <strong>Dexterity</strong>, <strong>Precision</strong>, and <strong>Resistance stats</strong>, customizing your build to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/023e7ea32893eece5a112c004c7b63a1.poster.avif?t=1785259737\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/023e7ea32893eece5a112c004c7b63a1.webm?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/023e7ea32893eece5a112c004c7b63a1.mp4?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A DARK, MYSTERIOUS STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore Ashford Hollow, the city feels under siege, but by no army you can see. Only the Hollows remain: once-human, sentinels stripped of their minds by The Voice, endlessly patrolling the streets like puppets caught in a ritual they no longer understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/1783a27a07f3cbb6014b526adac1596f.poster.avif?t=1785259737\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/1783a27a07f3cbb6014b526adac1596f.webm?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694600/extras/1783a27a07f3cbb6014b526adac1596f.mp4?t=1785259737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Precision-based combat inspired by Souls-like design,  read enemy intentions, punish openings, master timing, and survive lethal encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Major Boss Adaptability to the player's current weapons and madness gauge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deep RPG progression with fully customizable builds, stats, weapons, and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dynamic sanity system that reshapes gameplay, visuals, enemy behavior, and even fragments of the lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Environmental storytelling through hidden fragments of lore, world details, and enigmatic NPCS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Loot, inventory, quests, and equipment management integrated into a classic ARPG structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Victorian aesthetic fused with cosmic horror influences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Estimated playtime: 8+ hours per run (high replayability). (Work in progress)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=